README.md
    29→## Overview
    30→This SDK is designed to interact with the [3x-ui](https://github.com/MHSanaei/3x-ui) app in a more object-oriented way. It provides both synchronous and asynchronous methods to interact with the app. The SDK is designed to be as simple as possible to use, while still providing a lot of flexibility and uses `Pydantic` models to validate the data.<br>
    43→## Quick Start
    44→You can use both synchronous and asynchronous methods to interact with the 3x-ui app. Both APIs have the same methods and return the same data, so it's up to you to choose which one to use.<br>
    48→### Installation
